{"id":"t8ooa15iduz6u03b6x6jbc4aj","title":"以太坊费用机制：单维度 vs 多维度","originalTitle":"More Meters or More Prices? One- vs. Multi-dimensional Fee Mechanisms on Ethereum","summary":"以太坊研究团队对比了单维度和多维度费用机制，发现多维度机制在提高执行量的同时增加了拥堵，而单维度机制则在较高目标比例下实现更高执行量和较低拥堵，但牺牲了状态增长。在4/5目标比例下，多维度机制的执行量达到214.8M-244.2M，状态增长恢复到94.0-96.0 GiB/年，但仍有38.8%-40.8%的区块接近上限。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Ethereum Research"},"links":{"original":"https://ethresear.ch/t/more-meters-or-more-prices-one-vs-multi-dimensional-fee-mechanisms-on-ethereum/26244#post_1"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-12T15:28:58.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-12T15:52:17.085Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-12T15:52:17.085Z","category":"crypto-defi","tags":["研究报告","Ethereum"],"score":42,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"a4b32da5-2047-4542-a1d3-70b6f245d7bb","title":"以太坊费用机制对比：执行量与拥堵的权衡"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"@M1kuW1ll Fei Wu","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"a4b32da5-2047-4542-a1d3-70b6f245d7bb","title":"以太坊费用机制对比：执行量与拥堵的权衡"}],"topics":[{"slug":"ethereum","name":"以太坊 / ETH"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fTS58lnvZf_s","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}